<title>USA: Trident Microsystems CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Trident Microsystems CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trident Microsystems Inc said Friday its Chief Financial Officer James Lindstrom has resigned and wil be joining a private company.</p>
<p>Trident's President and Chief Executive Officer Frank Lin will take over Lindtrom's responsibilities until a new chief financial officer is found, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Lindstrom will act as a consultant to the firm until the replacement is found.</p>
<p>Trident designs, develops and markets integrated circuit graphics controllers and multimedia video processing chipsets.</p>
</text>
